+# required: false, and no meson_options.txt entry: this is a downstream BSP delta,
+# and the only consumer stubs itself out when the dependency is missing, so an
+# absent ffmpeg has to degrade rather than fail configure. The three libraries are
+# taken together because the decoder needs all of them (decode, image layout,
+# colour conversion) and a partial set would fail at link time instead of here.
